  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS 9539 PPG GEF &quot;A Sustainable, Green, Blue, and Digital Havana&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: A Sustainable, Green, Blue, and Digital Havana. The project aims to contribute to the integrated urban and territorial planning of the City of Havana through innovative sustainable solutions for resilient, low carbon, nature positive, and development with social equity. The project has 5 components.</narrative>
  </description>
